# Interview Exercise

Rapid prototype repo. Stack: Next.js 15, TypeScript, Tailwind v4, Zustand, Vitest.

## Commands

Prefer `make install`, `make dev`, `make verify` over raw npm scripts.

## Context loading

Before broad exploration, read `docs/context/retrieval-index.md`. Pin minimum files for the task.

## Quality gate

Run `make verify` before declaring work complete.

## Session state

Update `PROGRESS.md` (RALPH format) after multi-step work. Durable decisions go in `MEMORY.md`.
